Z||000000||Father-of-Fiero-owner||12-20-1999||04:51 PM||||I tried changing the filter and fluid and still no drive and actually now reverse is slipping a little also. So it looks like time to put in another tranny. The price of a rebuild was $900-$1000 or a used with 30 warrantee for about half of that. I may try to install myself seeing the overtime I've been working is done for the year. Thanks to everyone that replied. This is a good site, keep up the good work||||reg||9
Z||000001||DRH||12-20-1999||05:10 PM||||I would suggest a rebuild over a used. Even with a 30 day, it could do the same thing yours is doing in a couple of months. Check around, prices may vary. Compare having yours rebuilt vs. buying a rebuild with yours as a core. <P>You can save quite a bit pulling and installing yourself. ||||reg||1
